            <ArticleTitle>Guinea pig models of asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>Unit 5.26</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/0471141755.ph0526s16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This unit describes methods for establishing guinea pig models of asthma. Detailed descriptions are provided so that investigators can establish preparations in which bronchoconstriction, airways hyperresponsiveness, cough and airways inflammation can be studied.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
